Marked the invalid-profile branch as cold with `__builtin_expect` so the compiler lays out the valid path fall-through and can hoist the field load; the fast path now avoids taken-branch overhead in the hot decode loop.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    if (__builtin_expect((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields), 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].num;
}
```